{"id":"au_rnd_subsidy","category":"diplomatic","historical":false,"title":{"en":"A Subsidy for the Continental Allies","tr":"Kıtadaki Müttefiklere Sübvansiyon"},"text":{"en":"The government's allies on the Continent have men but not money. Ministers weigh paying for another coalition army with British gold against the cost to the Exchequer and the budget of the navy.","tr":"Hükûmetin kıtadaki müttefiklerinin askeri var ama parası yok. Bakanlar, bir başka koalisyon ordusunu İngiliz altınıyla finanse etmenin Hazine ve donanma bütçesi üzerindeki maliyetini tartıyor."},"image":"trade","trigger":{"date_from":{"year":1805,"month":8},"scenarios":["austerlitz"],"countries":["GBR"]},"mtth":70,"cooldown":20,"options":[{"id":"pay","name":{"en":"Pay the subsidy in full","tr":"Sübvansiyonu tamamen öde"},"tip":{"en":"-120 gold, +6 prestige, relations with Austria +15","tr":"-120 altın, +6 prestij, Avusturya ile ilişkiler +15"},"effects":[{"type":"gold","value":-120},{"type":"prestige","value":6},{"type":"relation","value":15,"target":"AUT"}],"ai_weight":2,"requires":[{"type":"treasury_above","value":120}]},{"id":"loan","name":{"en":"Offer a smaller loan on security","tr":"Teminatlı daha küçük bir borç sun"},"tip":{"en":"-50 gold, +2 prestige","tr":"-50 altın, +2 prestij"},"effects":[{"type":"gold","value":-50},{"type":"prestige","value":2}],"ai_weight":2,"requires":[{"type":"treasury_above","value":50}]},{"id":"refuse","name":{"en":"Refuse and spend on the fleet","tr":"Reddet ve parayı donanmaya harca"},"tip":{"en":"+1 stability, -2 prestige, +1 ships of the line","tr":"+1 istikrar, -2 prestij, +1 hat gemisi"},"effects":[{"type":"stability","value":1},{"type":"prestige","value":-2},{"type":"add_regiments","unit":"ship_of_the_line","n":1}],"ai_weight":1}]},
{"id":"au_rnd_conscription","category":"military","historical":false,"title":{"en":"Conscription Quotas and Draft Evasion","tr":"Zorunlu Askerlik Kotaları ve Kaçaklar"},"text":{"en":"The war ministry demands more men than the districts can easily provide. Prefects report draft evaders hiding in the hills, and parish priests complain that the farms are going short of hands in the sowing season.","tr":"Savaş bakanlığı bölgelerin kolayca sağlayabileceğinden fazla adam istiyor. Valiler dağlarda saklanan asker kaçaklarını bildiriyor, papazlar ise ekim mevsiminde çiftliklerin işgücü sıkıntısı çektiğinden yakınıyor."},"image":"uprising","trigger":{"date_from":{"year":1805,"month":8},"scenarios":["austerlitz"],"countries":["FRA","ITA","AUT","RUS","PRU","BAV","WUR"],"conds":[{"type":"at_war"}]},"mtth":55,"cooldown":16,"options":[{"id":"enforce","name":{"en":"Enforce the quotas strictly","tr":"Kotaları sıkı uygula"},"tip":{"en":"+5 manpower, -2 stability, -4 peasants satisfaction","tr":"+5 insan gücü, -2 istikrar, köylüler memnuniyeti -4"},"effects":[{"type":"manpower","value":5},{"type":"stability","value":-2},{"type":"class_sat","value":-4,"class":"peasants"}],"ai_weight":2},{"id":"substitutes","name":{"en":"Allow paid substitutes","tr":"Ücretli vekil gönderilmesine izin ver"},"tip":{"en":"+50 gold, +1 manpower, +2 merchants satisfaction","tr":"+50 altın, +1 insan gücü, tüccarlar memnuniyeti +2"},"effects":[{"type":"gold","value":50},{"type":"manpower","value":1},{"type":"class_sat","value":2,"class":"merchants"}],"ai_weight":1},{"id":"relax","name":{"en":"Relax the quotas this season","tr":"Bu mevsim kotaları gevşet"},"tip":{"en":"+2 stability, -2 manpower, +3 peasants satisfaction","tr":"+2 istikrar, -2 insan gücü, köylüler memnuniyeti +3"},"effects":[{"type":"stability","value":2},{"type":"manpower","value":-2},{"type":"class_sat","value":3,"class":"peasants"}],"ai_weight":1}]},
{"id":"au_rnd_requisitions","category":"military","historical":false,"title":{"en":"The Army Lives off the Land","tr":"Ordu Ülkeden Geçiniyor"},"text":{"en":"Napoleonic-era armies move faster than any supply train can follow and march as far as the fields allow. Quartermasters report that farms along the line of march are being stripped, and the villagers are muttering.","tr":"Napolyon dönemi orduları hiçbir ikmal kolunun yetişemeyeceği kadar hızlı hareket ediyor ve tarlaların izin verdiği yere kadar yürüyor. İntendanlar, yürüyüş hattı boyunca çiftliklerin soyulduğunu ve köylülerin söylendiğini bildiriyor."},"image":"famine","trigger":{"date_from":{"year":1805,"month":8},"scenarios":["austerlitz"],"countries":["FRA","AUT","RUS","BAV","WUR","PRU","GBR","SWE"],"conds":[{"type":"at_war"}]},"mtth":50,"cooldown":12,"options":[{"id":"requisition","name":{"en":"Requisition freely and pay in scrip","tr":"Serbestçe el koy, senetle öde"},"tip":{"en":"+2 manpower, -2 stability, +4 unrest","tr":"+2 insan gücü, -2 istikrar, +4 huzursuzluk"},"effects":[{"type":"manpower","value":2},{"type":"stability","value":-2},{"type":"province_unrest","value":4}],"ai_weight":2},{"id":"purchase","name":{"en":"Buy supplies at fair prices","tr":"Erzakı adil fiyatla satın al"},"tip":{"en":"-60 gold, +1 stability","tr":"-60 altın, +1 istikrar"},"effects":[{"type":"gold","value":-60},{"type":"stability","value":1}],"ai_weight":1,"requires":[{"type":"treasury_above","value":60}]},{"id":"magazines","name":{"en":"Build magazines and slow the advance","tr":"Depolar kur, ilerleyişi yavaşlat"},"tip":{"en":"-40 gold, +1 manpower, -1 prestige","tr":"-40 altın, +1 insan gücü, -1 prestij"},"effects":[{"type":"gold","value":-40},{"type":"manpower","value":1},{"type":"prestige","value":-1}],"ai_weight":1,"requires":[{"type":"treasury_above","value":40}]}]},
{"id":"au_rnd_privateers","category":"economic","historical":false,"title":{"en":"Privateers and the Blockade","tr":"Korsanlar ve Abluka"},"text":{"en":"Merchants in the Channel ports complain about privateers on one side and the Royal Navy's blockade on the other. A single convoy lost or saved can swing the quarter's customs revenue.","tr":"Manş limanlarındaki tüccarlar bir yanda korsanlardan, öte yanda Kraliyet Donanması'nın ablukasından yakınıyor. Kaybedilen ya da kurtarılan tek bir konvoy çeyreğin gümrük gelirini değiştirebilir."},"image":"harbor","trigger":{"date_from":{"year":1805,"month":8},"scenarios":["austerlitz"],"countries":["GBR","FRA","SPA","NLD"],"conds":[{"type":"at_war"}]},"mtth":55,"cooldown":16,"options":[{"id":"convoy","name":{"en":"Organise escorted convoys","tr":"Korumalı konvoylar düzenle"},"tip":{"en":"-50 gold, +10% trade income for 4 turns","tr":"-50 altın, 4 tur boyunca %+10 ticaret geliri"},"effects":[{"type":"gold","value":-50},{"type":"temp_mod","mods":{"trade":0.1},"turns":4}],"ai_weight":2,"requires":[{"type":"treasury_above","value":50}]},{"id":"privateer","name":{"en":"License more privateers","tr":"Daha fazla korsana ruhsat ver"},"tip":{"en":"+70 gold, relations with Britain -10","tr":"+70 altın, Britanya ile ilişkiler -10"},"effects":[{"type":"gold","value":70},{"type":"relation","value":-10,"target":"GBR"}],"ai_weight":1},{"id":"neutral_flag","name":{"en":"Ship under neutral flags","tr":"Tarafsız bayrak altında taşı"},"tip":{"en":"+30 gold, -1 prestige","tr":"+30 altın, -1 prestij"},"effects":[{"type":"gold","value":30},{"type":"prestige","value":-1}],"ai_weight":1}]}
